 "specialRules": {
  "littleSer": "Little Ser is represented by a token and can be placed, with the Monkey Business keyword, on a Knight Board, the Monster Sheet, the Clash Board (or the Exploration deck). At the start of each Expedition, place Little Ser on Ser Sonch's Knight Board. On the Clash Board it does not occupy spaces. If you stop using the game element Little Ser is on (e.g. the Knight that Little Ser was on dies) place Little Ser on Ser Sonch's Board (even if it was Ser Sonch who died). Monkey Business: X - Place Little Ser on X. If Monkey Business has no cost, you may use it at the beginning of your turn."
 },
